{"id": "mrs-angel", "status": "published", "category": "Entrepreneurship", "title": "Mrs.Angel Taiwanese Bubble Tea Shop", "subtitle": "My first hands-on food-service venture taught me that starting a business is easier than running one.", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-mrs-angel.png", "width": 796, "height": 531, "scale": 1, "srcset": "/assets/responsive/cover-mrs-angel-b6e48a47100b-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/cover-mrs-angel-b6e48a47100b-796.webp 796w"}, "html": "<section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Starting with a campus bubble tea shop</h3><p>While studying in Japan, I applied for a job at a campus bubble tea shop. During a conversation with the operator, I suggested changes to the business. He asked me to make a concrete case, so I wrote a business proposal explaining how the products and operations could be adjusted. I later became the shop’s manager.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact note-gallery-pair\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/campus-bubble-tea-press-release.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/campus-bubble-tea-press-release.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/campus-bubble-tea-press-release-b963d65a18f4-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/campus-bubble-tea-press-release-b963d65a18f4-532.webp 532w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A Kokushikan University press release about the campus bubble tea shop, dated July 19, 2019.\" width=\"532\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A Kokushikan University press release about the campus bubble tea shop, dated July 19, 2019.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/campus-bubble-tea-feature.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/campus-bubble-tea-feature.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/campus-bubble-tea-feature-55f1940a1e2d-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/campus-bubble-tea-feature-55f1940a1e2d-800.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A feature page introducing Kokushikan University’s cafeteria and campus bubble tea shop.\" width=\"800\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A feature page introducing Kokushikan University’s cafeteria and campus bubble tea shop.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-tea-drink-record.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-tea-drink-record.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-tea-drink-record-30af16accf05-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-tea-drink-record-30af16accf05-881.webp 881w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A photograph of two tea drinks.\" width=\"881\" height=\"659\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A photograph of two tea drinks.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-harvest-festival-2019.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-harvest-festival-2019.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-harvest-festival-2019-aa8306da3730-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-harvest-festival-2019-aa8306da3730-530.webp 530w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A harvest-festival stall and the original social post.\" width=\"530\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A harvest-festival stall and the original social post.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Turning an idea into a storefront</h3><p>After gaining experience with promotional materials and product adjustments, we began discussing a shop in Kyodo’s shopping district. I participated in preparing and operating Mrs.Angel. My account from that period records approximately six weeks from the initial idea to opening.</p><p>Once the shop was running, opening day became only the beginning. Staff scheduling, POS and payment-service agreements, ingredient adjustments, tax filing, and profit-and-loss calculations all required attention.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-kyodo-promotion.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-kyodo-promotion.png\" alt=\"A promotional image of Mrs.Angel drinks in Kyodo.\" width=\"405\" height=\"411\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A promotional image of Mrs.Angel drinks in Kyodo.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Responding to seasonality and the pandemic</h3><p>Sales declined in autumn. We learned that Taiwanese drinking habits could not simply be transferred to the Japanese market, and that seasonal preferences affected demand. We adjusted the menu, introduced products such as taro balls, and joined Uber Eats early.</p><p>When the pandemic reduced walk-in traffic, we already had a delivery customer base. Joining the delivery platform before the disruption intensified was an important decision that helped the shop through that period.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-chicken-delivery-listings.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-chicken-delivery-listings.png\" alt=\"A delivery-platform screenshot showing Mrs.Angel and the Taiwanese fried chicken listing together.\" width=\"404\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A delivery-platform screenshot showing Mrs.Angel and the Taiwanese fried chicken listing together.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-uber-eats-launch.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-uber-eats-launch.png\" alt=\"Uber Eats delivery equipment and promotional materials.\" width=\"471\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Uber Eats delivery equipment and promotional materials.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Learning what it takes to keep a business running</h3><p>This was my first hands-on food-service venture. The harder work was the daily adjustment of products, staffing, and costs as demand changed. It also became a starting point for how I understood operations and supply chain problems.</p></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Later delivery-platform records</h3><p>These later store and platform records include operating reports for 2025–2026. They are presented separately from my university-era business experience.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-platform-listing.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-platform-listing.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-platform-listing-0cf38b850b1c-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-platform-listing-0cf38b850b1c-578.webp 578w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A later delivery-platform storefront screenshot.\" width=\"578\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A later delivery-platform storefront screenshot.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-top-eats.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-top-eats.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-top-eats-0c0036b36541-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-top-eats-0c0036b36541-849.webp 849w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"The platform’s Top Eats page, showing an evaluation period in May 2026.\" width=\"849\" height=\"389\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>The platform’s Top Eats page, showing an evaluation period in May 2026.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-operations-2025-2026.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-operations-2025-2026.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-operations-2025-2026-53f45f9532f9-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-operations-2025-2026-53f45f9532f9-848.webp 848w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"The platform’s operations page for May 1, 2025 through April 30, 2026.\" width=\"848\" height=\"378\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>The platform’s operations page for May 1, 2025 through April 30, 2026.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Images from the experience</h3><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-products.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-products.jpeg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-products-4c2199db3222-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-products-4c2199db3222-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A historical product photograph of Mrs.Angel drinks.\" width=\"1150\" height=\"927\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A historical product photograph of Mrs.Angel drinks.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-storefront.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-storefront.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-storefront-0e32ec47365e-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-storefront-0e32ec47365e-659.webp 659w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"The storefront in Kyodo’s shopping district.\" width=\"659\" height=\"559\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>The storefront in Kyodo’s shopping district.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-interior.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/mrs-angel-interior.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/mrs-angel-interior-c9ca27397461-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/mrs-angel-interior-c9ca27397461-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"The interior of Mrs.Angel.\" width=\"1152\" height=\"861\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>The interior of Mrs.Angel.</figcaption></figure></div></section>", "pending": "Full article coming soon.", "close": "Close"}